issue is that whether uniforms with different `writable` should be considered different. Not sure if this is a regression or intended behavior, but you can fix this by binding corresponding writable uniforms (https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1241).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3222398531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3222682723","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109962#issuecomment-3222682723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109962","id":3222682723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AFjxj","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T05:32:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T05:34:33Z","body":"See also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696\n\nCc @stuartcarnie @DarioSamo I guess we just made the other backends as strict as metal now? In which case I guess the right thing to do is modify the sample?\n\nEither like https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1174 or https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1241","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3222682723/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3223040203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109962#issuecomment-3223040203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109962","id":3223040203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AG7DL","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T07:54:46Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T07:56:56Z","body":"@clayjohn yes, fixing the samples is the right thing to do. The code in `reflect_spirv` was broken, as documented in #101696, it was reading `block`, but that was initialised to 0, and just by luck that it worked. It was updated to correctly determining whether a resource was writable in the shader:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/17fb6e3bd06f6425ad9ec0d93718ce8f848fc3fc/servers/rendering/rendering_device_commons.cpp#L1100-L1104\n\nThe fix was incorporated into #102552, as we removed a lot of specialised code in Metal to reflect SPIR-V. I thought it was noted in the PR that it would potentially affect other backends. I'll look through and see if i can find the note.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3223040203/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3224518849","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109962#issuecomment-3224518849","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109962","id":3224518849,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AMkDB","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url"