api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T02:49:55Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T02:49:55Z","body":"I think this is fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1247\nSo the standard way is to create 9 uniforms, right? I probably agree with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-2701322632 but it seems not feasible in Godot (and see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101696#issuecomment-3245131383)\n ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3290299657/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]